# Workflow plan step W1 (docs/WORKFLOW_PLAN.md, 2026-11-14): one steps bar for every single-region OpenFOAM case, not only
# those made from an STL. A fresh tutorial (the cavity, no mesh yet) goes from no mesh to results with only the bar's Next
# button: Generate mesh, then Run simulation, then Open in ParaView. The bar is on Overview, Mesh, Boundary conditions,
# Physics, Numerics and Run; a step clicked opens its page. Without field files the Boundaries step and the sidebar say so.
open $SB/ws/cavity
wait 10
assert text Not generated yet
assert text After the mesh
assert widget wf-next
screenshot $OUT/cavity_new.png
click wf-next
wait-until job finished timeout 60
wait 20
assert text cells, 3 patches
assert text 2 fields on 3 patches
assert text Not run yet
click nav:boundary conditions
wait 10
assert widget wf-next
click nav:physics
wait 10
assert widget wf-next
click nav:numerics
wait 10
assert widget wf-next
assert text Schemes and solvers set
click nav:mesh
wait 10
assert widget wf-next
click nav:run
wait 10
assert widget wf-next
click nav:overview
wait 10
click wf-next
wait-until job running timeout 60
wait-until job finished timeout 120
wait 30
# the Run page's column folds the steps done into one line
assert text All done: Mesh, Boundaries, Physics, Numerics, Run, Results
click nav:overview
wait 10
assert text Results to 0.5
screenshot $OUT/cavity_done.png
# after the run the Next is the Results page, and there ParaView
click wf-next
wait-until page Results
click wf-next
wait 20
assert file $LAUNCH
# a step clicked opens its page
click wf#1>step
wait-until page Boundary conditions
# no field files: the step and the sidebar say so
shell mv 0 0.away
wait-until text No field files timeout 10
assert text No field files
assert text No fields
screenshot $OUT/cavity_nofields.png
shell mv 0.away 0
# the app looks at the disk every 1.5 s
wait-until not text No fields timeout 10
assert text 2 fields on 3 patches
